            "text": "You and Paimon deliver the unconscious man to Lumidouce Harbor.\\nThe people there immediately take him to receive medical treatment.\\nKnowing that he is in good hands, the two of you return to where you were before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740740208"
            ]
          },
          "740740208": {
            "id": "740740208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
