            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Lo, this place is the Orthant of Wishes, the Temple of Wishes, the Room of Wishes...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740740210"
            ]
          },
          "740740210": {
            "id": "740740210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Often contradicting\"... \"Born in an instant, your company in eternal rest, never separated\"... \"The tainted fruits of sin\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740740211"
            ]
          },
          "740740211": {
            "id": "740740211",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Looks like a riddle!",
            "nextDialogs": [
